;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Okay, I'm calling <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>! I don't care if it comes out that I lied.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no more time to hesitate.<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\心臓の鼓動.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
The index finger of my right hand wouldn't move toward the call button.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In my heart I shouted "Hyah," and pressed my index finger onto the button with more force than necessary.<PG>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
3 seconds... 5 seconds... 10 seconds...
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The person you are calling is unavailable. We apologize, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
As if I'd been waiting for those words, I hung up right away.<PG>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
I hadn't been able to say what I had to say, and yet, this <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="あんどかん">relief</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My loud heartbeat was slowly settling down.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As if to shatter that <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="あんどかん">relief</STYLE>, the phone rang shrilly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">“Niimura-senpai”</STYLE> was displayed on the incoming-call screen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do I do... Should I answer, or should I calm myself down a little first?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stopped thinking and pressed the call button.
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Hi-iii, it's Goto!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered in a voice more cheerful than necessary.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whether it sounded forced or not, I don't know.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. What's up? Find out anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s voice was the same as always.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's not exactly that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">But, being alone, I'm scared after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh―!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The instant I said that, I thought, oh no.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had just told her I was alone right now.<PG>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh... So </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're home alone right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You did say before that your parents had a class reunion. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm alone right now, too. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s coming home late today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">The way she put it snagged on me strangely, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s voice was no different in particular.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aren't your parents worried? On a day when an incident like that happened, their </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> alone at home?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh... no, I called them just now, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm. Well, make sure you lock up tight."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes... but it's scary after all, isn't it, when something like this happens so close by."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, actually, I was wondering whether to call you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, too. And then I got a call from </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> I'm not, but being alone does make me feel uneasy after all."</STYLE><PG>
Was I fated to talk with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> either way?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, whether I call her or she calls me should make a big difference to how what we say from here comes across.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPN>Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s tone of voice dropped a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Can I ask you one weird question?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"What is it...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Why... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">did you call me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Huh?"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Feeling uneasy alone, that's not like </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Even though earlier you were so fired up, saying you wanted to solve the incident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Ah... ah... do you think so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Haha... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ha..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Something?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Something, like... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Ah... um... uh..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"What's with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Could it be, you're scared of me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> being this scared means... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">could it be, you found something out?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"What, no answer at all?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Se... Se..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"Hmm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"Uh... I..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1"><TXSPS>"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4"><TXSPN>"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"N-no, sorry! For once </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were scared, so I thought I'd tease you, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Doing that at a time like this was too insensitive, I guess! Ahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> suddenly pitched her voice higher and said it brightly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's nothing! Nothing... Don't worry about it, okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, my goosebumps just wouldn't go away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry! Really, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! I'm gonna hang up. The mood got weird somehow. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Tomorrow, let's go see how </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s doing! Good night!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> hung up on me.
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<BR>
The beep-beep sound from the phone went on for a while.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I slowly put the phone down on the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, I couldn't ask what I wanted to ask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> seemed somehow strange―or so I felt...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had she really just meant to tease me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else...<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, a short ringtone sounded.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was a little startled, but it seemed a message had arrived.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
............?
{PAUSE ""}
　It was from <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why a message right after the call?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I opened the message.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Written there was this.<PG>
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
